            "review_title": "Review at Jeon Sool Bap",
            "review_text": "Mai P\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nWorse dinning experience ever.. DISAPPOINTED!!!\nMay 2016 • Friends\nI've been there yesterday with friends for dinner as we used to eat here few times already. The last time were good, but this time, I must say that I would never come back again. The food was not tasty as last times (but still okay for me). But the service was extremely disappointed and speechless. The vietnamese lady, introduced herself as the manager there, instead of solving our issue, she made the situation even worse. What you would feel when the manager say \"if you dont talk to me, then talk to yourself\" when we ask for higher management/ owner cz we just could not stand with her attitude. Maybe they want to save cost and charge us for 3rd round of kimchi, but OMG, how comes a Korean restaurant want to limit guests for kim chi and again, highlight is the \"so called manager\" with such inappropriate manner toward the customers. Nice job, keep on treating your customers like this, you will loose them all soon anyway.\nRead more\nWritten May 26, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
